--   setting question papers according to the curriculum, making the entire
--   process more efficient and accurate. The airline industry has also
--   benefited from AI. Airlines are using AI to gauge the best time to buy
--   airline tickets, predict flight delays, and monitor baggage handling.
--   AI is also used to monitor weather patterns and air traffic, helping
--   airlines to make informed decisions about flight schedules and routes.
--   In the healthcare industry, AI has the potential to improve patient
