--   analyze medical images, such as X-rays and MRIs, with greater accuracy
--   and speed than humans. AI can also help in predicting disease outbreaks
--   and identifying high-risk patients. Additionally, AI can analyze
--   electronic health records and provide personalized treatment
--   recommendations.
